    <string name="faq_what_is_mirailink_q">What is MiraiLink and how does it work?</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_mirailink_a">MiraiLink is a social and dating app designed for anime, manga, and gaming enthusiasts. We connect you with like-minded people based on shared cultural interests and geographic proximity.</string>
    <string name="faq_50_points_q">How is my location handled and why are up to 50 points saved?</string>
    <string name="faq_50_points_a">To calculate distance to other users and enable future features like reunions or visited places, we keep a history of up to the last 50 points where you used the app. A new position is only recorded if you moved more than 5 km or after 24 hours. Once 50 points are exceeded, the oldest ones are automatically removed. Your exact location is never visible to other users.</string>
    <string name="faq_residence_vs_travelers_q">What is the difference between place of residence and current location?</string>
    <string name="faq_residence_vs_travelers_a">Your place of residence is the city shown on your profile ("Lives in Palma"). By default, searches compare residence locations. If you enable the travelers option, the app will match users who are physically within your radius right now even if they reside elsewhere.</string>
    <string name="faq_premium_q">Which features will be Premium in the future?</string>
    <string name="faq_premium_a">Currently all MiraiLink features are 100% free. In the future, advanced features such as international passport mode, search radius beyond 50 km, or specialized traveler searches will be part of optional plans to support app development.</string>
